  "Software Details": "Dettagli del software",
  "The Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is designed to revolutionize the way you promote your business. With its robust features, you can easily activate, generate, and modify business cards to suit your brand's needs. Whether you're a new business owner or looking to refresh your brand's image, this module provides you with the flexibility to design business cards that truly represent your company's identity.": "Il modulo Marketing in eCommerceGo SaaS è progettato per rivoluzionare il modo in cui promuovi la tua attività. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Visualizza la demo dal vivo",
  "Enhance Your Business Reach with the Marketing Module": "Migliora la portata della tua attività con il modulo Marketing",
  "Boost your sales with our powerful marketing module, designed to streamline campaigns, track performance, and drive growth effortlessly": "Aumenta le tue vendite con il nostro potente modulo di marketing, progettato per semplificare le campagne, monitorare le prestazioni e favorire la crescita senza sforzo",
  "Create and Edit Your Business Profile with Ease": "Crea e modifica il tuo profilo aziendale con facilità",
  "Starting a new business or managing multiple brands? The Marketing Module offers seamless options for creating new business profiles and editing them as your needs evolve. This flexibility ensures that your business information is always up to date, keeping your brand relevant in a competitive market. The module’s user-friendly interface makes it simple to add or update contact details, logos, and promotional messages, ensuring your brand always looks professional.": "Avviare una nuova attività o gestire più marchi? ",
  "Choose from a Variety of Business Themes": "Scegli tra una varietà di temi aziendali",
  "The Marketing Module also offers a range of customizable business themes to enhance your brand’s presentation. Whether you’re looking for something sleek and modern or classic and traditional, you can select from various themes that best align with your brand’s personality. Each theme is designed to maximize visual appeal and ensure consistency across all your marketing materials, helping you create a cohesive brand experience for your audience.": "Il modulo Marketing offre anche una gamma di temi aziendali personalizzabili per migliorare la presentazione del tuo marchio. ",
  "Drive Growth with Customizable Marketing Campaigns": "Promuovi la crescita con campagne di marketing personalizzabili",
  "Take your business to the next level by launching dynamic marketing campaigns directly from the platform. The Marketing Module allows you to create and run targeted campaigns that can reach your desired audience effectively. Use the platforms intuitive tools to customize your campaign strategies, set your budget, and track performance in real-time. This ensures your marketing efforts are both impactful and measurable, allowing for continuous improvement.": "Porta la tua attività al livello successivo lanciando campagne di marketing dinamiche direttamente dalla piattaforma. ",
  "Streamline Your Marketing Efforts with All-in-One Tools": "Semplifica le tue attività di marketing con strumenti all-in-one",
  "With the Marketing Module, managing your business’s marketing efforts has never been easier. The module combines all necessary tools into one cohesive platform, allowing you to handle everything from business card creation to campaign management without ever leaving the platform. This integration simplifies your workflow, saves time, and reduces the complexity of managing multiple marketing tools, making it an essential solution for any business looking to grow.": "Con il Modulo Marketing, gestire le attività di marketing della tua azienda non è mai stato così semplice. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Perché scegliere moduli dedicati",
  "for your business?": "per la tua attività?",
  "With EcommerceGo, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Con EcommerceGo puoi gestire comodamente tutte le funzioni aziendali da un'unica posizione",
  "Empower Your Workforce with EcommerceGo": "Potenzia la tua forza lavoro con EcommerceGo",
  "Access over Premium Add-ons for Product Enquiry, Product Review, Product Quick-view, and more, all in one place!": "Accesso ai componenti aggiuntivi Premium per la richiesta di informazioni sul prodotto, la revisione del prodotto, la visualizzazione rapida del prodotto e altro ancora, tutto in un unico posto!",
